Maintainer: REMnux Distribution <distro@remnux.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, python3
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/zrax/pycdc
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: pycdc
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: C++ Python bytecode disassembler and decompiler
 Decompyle++ (pycdc) turns compiled Python bytecode back into readable Python
 source, and pycdas disassembles it. This package builds both from upstream
 source (commit b428976), replacing the earlier package that shipped prebuilt
 x86-64 binaries.
